# put all when nothing goes in. Decimus (10), in the temple (3001), carries a leather vest (616, weight 100) and has
# a box (3033: holds 100, nothing over 50) at his feet. put all.vest box finds the vest too heavy, and put
# all.nothing box finds nothing by that name: stock said nothing at all (#91); now "You aren't carrying anything
# that fits."
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@obj 616 3001
@obj 3033 3001
get vest
put all.vest box
put all.nothing box
